{"product":{"id":9434011730174,"title":"Athlete Essential Stack","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProtein, creatine and a shaker bottle. This is the foundational training stack — the three things that every serious lifter ends up buying eventually, now bundled together at a price that makes buying them separately look like the expensive option.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAN Critical Whey Protein (25 Servings) delivers 24g of protein per serving from a four-source grass-fed dairy protein blend at just 120 calories. Post-workout, between meals, or any time of day — this is the protein product you reach for when daily protein targets matter and ingredient quality matters more. Informed Sport certified on selected flavours, UK-made to GMP standards.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAN Creatine Monohydrate (50 Servings) is pure pharmaceutical-grade creatine monohydrate — the single most clinically researched performance supplement in existence. 5g per day saturates muscle phosphocreatine stores for faster ATP regeneration during heavy lifts and explosive work. No fillers, no proprietary blends, no loading gimmicks required. Just creatine at the dose the research actually uses. UK-made, GMP-certified, 50 servings per pack — over a month and a half of daily supply.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSNH 2.0 Shaker Bottle 750ml ties the stack together. 750ml capacity, BPA-free, leak-proof, freezer-safe for ice-cold shakes in Sri Lanka's heat. Mix your creatine into your post-workout protein shake in one go — one scoop of each, one shake, one bottle to wash. Clean daily habits start with the right equipment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProtein for recovery. Creatine for performance. Shaker to make both effortless.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"_p_1x4zg_107\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNormally LKR 30,997. Bundle price LKR 27,999. You save LKR 2,998.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Sports Nutrition Hub (SNH)","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-08-29T21:24:20+05:30","handle":"whey-training-stack","updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:54:02+05:30","published_at":"2026-09-26T14:39:33+05:30","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"bundle, Creatine, shaker, Strength, training, whey-protein","variants":[{"id":48805130109182,"product_id":9434011730174,"title":"Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested \/ Black","price":"27999.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-08-29T21:24:20+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:54:02+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":67575368024318,"product_id":9434011730174,"title":"Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested \/ White","price":"27999.00","sku":null,"position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested","option2":"White","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-26T13:28:57+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:54:02+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":67575368057086,"product_id":9434011730174,"title":"Chocolate Milkshake - Informed-Sport Tested \/ Harbor Grey","price":"27999.00","sku":null,"position":3,"com